{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Prometheus metrics from mm runtime: frames, controller, order execution, latencies. Requires runtime metrics on host:8000 scraped by Prometheus (see docker/prometheus.yml).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "**Source:** `mm/observability/subscribers.py` + in-process `/metrics` (`mm/observability/registry.py`).\n\n**If charts are empty:**\n1. **Scrape:** Prometheus targets `host.docker.internal:8000` (see `docker/prometheus.yml`). The **runtime must run on the host** with `metrics_enabled` / port **8000** (or set `MM_METRICS_PORT` and change Prometheus). In Prometheus UI → **Status → Targets**, `market_maker` should be **UP**.\n2. **Histogram rows** stay empty until you have **execution sync** traffic (`mm_order_sync_latency_ms_*`, `mm_frame_to_exec_*` buckets need observations).\n3. **Logs (Loki):** Relative `log_path` is resolved to the **repo** `logs/` directory so Alloy’s `./logs` mount sees lines. Restart runtime after upgrading.\n\n**Rates:** `rate(...[$__rate_interval])` — frames, decisions, sync rounds, venue place/cancel accept counts.\n\n**Latencies (histograms):** `mm_frame_to_exec_sync_latency_ms` = wall ms from `StrategyInputFrame.created_at_ms` to `ExecutionSyncRequested`; `mm_market_window_end_to_exec_sync_latency_ms` = `ExecutionSyncRequested.timestamp_ms` − primary `t_end_ms`; `mm_order_sync_latency_ms` = sync request timestamp → next `execution:state` snapshot timestamp.\n\n**Gauges (last scrape):** `mm_order_sync_create_count` / `mm_order_sync_cancel_count` (per sync batch), controller latency gauge, live orders.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Notes",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-mm" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-mm" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job=\"market_maker\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Prometheus scrape (1=UP)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus-mm" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
